' ARCADE's Rivet build description. The build file is ordinary ArcoBASIC; Rivet records a single
' fission-backed compile action that invokes `ArcoFission native arcade.abas -o build/arcade`.

Arcade = BUILD.ArcoCapsule("arcade")
Arcade.Entry = "arcade.abas"
Arcade.OutputDirectory = "build"
ignored = Arcade.Build()
